          "title": "You'll want to know: ശിക്ഷ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ശിക്ഷ — śikṣa — \"punishment; a sentence\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തെറ്റിന് അവന് ചെറിയ ഒരു ശിക്ഷ കിട്ടി. teṟṟinŭ avanŭ ceṟiya oru śikṣa kiṭṭi. He got a small punishment for the mistake."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A punishment is കിട്ടുക, received, or വിധിക്കുക, passed by a court."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ശിക്ഷ (śikṣa) is borrowed from Sanskrit śikṣā, \"learning, study\", which later also came to mean \"punishment\" (CDIAL 12432). The lesson and the penalty share one word."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
